sim/sim.py and sim/search.py re-implement two priority formulas so that they can be replayed:
- the slot-allocation formula of D. Franzen's ARC-AGI-3 Milestone 2 solution
  (https://github.com/da-fr/arc-agi-3-solution), Apache-2.0
- the D' priority formula by shiiin9
  (https://www.kaggle.com/code/shiiin9/affectify-arc-31-54-in-a-single-sub), Apache-2.0
Those formulas remain under their original licence.

The notebooks that notebook_tools/ edits are not included. They build on D. Franzen's solution and
Tufa Labs' Duck harness (https://github.com/Tufalabs/duck-harness), which keep their own terms.
Model weights are not included.
